 * while `d31_decoy_thin::Same` is a scalar struct. A fat walk that read only the LAST path segment
 * and ignored the qualifier could not tell the two apart, so this pair is what proves the qualifier
 * is actually read (0.3.1.0 degrau 31, the inversion half).
 */
pub type Same = []i64
